<concept id="cloning_a_template_50283a" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Cloning a Template</title>
     <shortdesc>You can clone an existing template that you have opened to make a new copy</shortdesc>
   <prolog>
      <author type="creator">Maanasa Suthrave</author>
      <critdates>
         <created date="Apr 16, 2019"/>
      </critdates>
       <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>template</keyword>
        <keyword>existing</keyword>
        <keyword>opened</keyword>
        <keyword>Cloning</keyword>
        <keyword>Template</keyword>
        <keyword>clone</keyword>
        <indexterm>template</indexterm>
        <indexterm>existing</indexterm>
        <indexterm>opened</indexterm>
      </keywords>
          <prodinfo>
        <prodname/>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <conbody>
      <p>You can clone an existing template that you have opened to make a new copy of the template.</p>
      <p>
         <b>Pre-requisites:</b>
      </p>
      <ul>
         <li>You must have an existing template opened in X-Author Contracts.</li>
      </ul>
   </conbody>
</concept>